  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, a mountebank has mastered a single skill beyond that skill’s normal boundaries, gaining results that others can only dream about. She gains the skill unlock powers for that skill as appropriate for her number of ranks in that skill. At 10th level and every five levels thereafter, she chooses an additional skill and gains skill unlock powers for that skill as well.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mountebank#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
